<p>A Foundation site is found by a conspiracy group, forcing an investigation committee to find those responsible while maintaining the Veil.</p>
<p><em>I moved and trimmed your thread summary, since it was taking up extra space in the main forum screen. Try to keep thread descriptions (the text in the little box under the thread title) and titles short so you don't crowd out other authors in the forum listing. ~Zyn</em></p>
<p>I’m not completely sure if the story is engaging enough for the reader, or whether the pacing is good. Most of my previous attempts at writing have failed at those points. I would really appreciate anyone pointing out the article’s faults and critiquing anything that might get this to a good enough Tale.</p>
<p>Link to the concept critique: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13367256">http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13367256</a></p>
<p>Link to the sandbox page: <a href="http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/stop-right-there">http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/stop-right-there</a></p>
<p><em>Noting that wordcount is approximately 3700 words. ~Zyn</em></p>

